---
Create a new project: a wirebug.toml manifest, a minimal main.wb and, when there is none, a .gitignore for the render output

Usage: wirebug init [DIR]

Arguments:
  [DIR]  The project directory, created if absent. Defaults to the current directory. The project is named after it. Refuses, writing nothing, if it already holds a wirebug.toml or a main.wb

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
